# The repo has mixed line endings and no normalisation, which is how a one-line change arrives as a
# whole-file diff and buries the real edit. Found by the accessibility lane on 2026-11-18.
#
# Text files are normalised to LF in the repository; Git still checks them out with the native
# ending on Windows. The two woff2 subsets and any future image are marked binary so Git never
# tries to "fix" their bytes.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
